# Implementation Plan - Remi's Investment Academy (Manzai Series)

## Goal Description
The user pointed out that Remi hasn't explained several key investment concepts to Yuto: Compound Interest, Dollar Cost Averaging, Long-term Investment, Contrarian Investing, FIRE, Dividend Aristocrats, Diversified Investment, and Future Chronology.
This plan proposes creating a series of **Manzai Scripts** (and optionally Manga Columns) to systematically cover these topics in an entertaining and educational way.

## User Review Required
> [!IMPORTANT]
> Please confirm the preferred format for these explanations.
> - **Option A (Recommended)**: Create a series of **Manzai Scripts** (1 topic per video) for short, engaging explanations.
> - **Option B**: Create **Manga "Column" Pages** to be inserted between existing manga episodes (text-heavy graphical explanations).
> - **Option C**: Create new **Manga Episodes** (drawing/plotting required) dedicated to these topics.

**I will proceed with Option A (Manzai Scripts) by default unless you request otherwise.**

